# {{lb|en|basketball}} The achievement of a two-digit number of all five of points scored, assists, rebounds, blocks, and steals in a single game.
#: ''There has been a single game in history in which the quintuple double occured. It was done by Ilimane Burgess on 4th March 2019 @Indiana, he scored 80 points, got 19 rebounds, dished 10 assists, stole the ball 11 times and blocked 12 shots.''

